<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Construct submersible barriers and turrets, perfect for indoor defenses.-->
  <VFES_ConcealedDefenses.description>建造水下屏障和炮塔，非常适合室内防御。</VFES_ConcealedDefenses.description>
  <VFES_ConcealedDefenses.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->hidden strength-->
    <li>subject-&gt;隐藏力量</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the art of concealment, making fortifications vanish before the enemy's eyes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;掌握了隐蔽的艺术，让防御工事在敌人眼前消失</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated with submersible turrets and traps, revealing strength at the moment of surprise-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创新潜水炮塔和陷阱，在瞬间出其不意时展现实力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed defenses that blend seamlessly with the environment, striking unseen-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的防御系统与环境无缝融合，引人注目</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created a network of hidden armaments, ensuring security through invisibility-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创建了一个隐藏武器网络，通过隐形确保安全</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->camouflaging power in plain sight-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;显而易见的伪装能力</li>
  </VFES_ConcealedDefenses.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: concealed defenses-->
  <VFES_ConcealedDefenses.label>隐蔽防御</VFES_ConcealedDefenses.label>
  <!--EN: Develop EMP traps and tesla blasters capable of stunning mechanoids.-->
  <VFES_EMPCannon.description>开发能够击晕机械体的电磁脉冲陷阱和特斯拉爆破器。</VFES_EMPCannon.description>
  <VFES_EMPCannon.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the silent storm-->
    <li>subject-&gt;无声的风暴</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted weapons that speak in the language of lightning, silencing the mechanical behemoths of war-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用闪电语言说话的精制武器，让战争中的机械巨兽陷入沉默</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->melded the might of electromagnetic pulses with strategic defense-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将电磁脉冲的威力与战略防御融为一体</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->paved the way for victory in silence, stunning adversaries with invisible force-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在沉默中为胜利铺平道路，用隐形力量击晕对手</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the dance of electrons to protect and paralyze-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;掌握了电子之舞来保护和瘫痪</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->commanding the battlefield with the whisper of currents-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用海流的低语指挥战场</li>
  </VFES_EMPCannon.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: electromagnetic pulse-->
  <VFES_EMPCannon.label>电磁脉冲</VFES_EMPCannon.label>
  <!--EN: Adapt spacecraft weaponry as part of your defensive systems.-->
  <VFES_Railgun.description>调整航天器武器作为防御系统的一部分。</VFES_Railgun.description>
  <VFES_Railgun.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->precision unleashed-->
    <li>subject-&gt;精准释放</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->adapted the devastating power of spacecraft armaments for ground warfare-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;调整了航天器武器的毁灭性力量以适应地面战争</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered railguns to deliver unmatched velocity and destruction-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的轨道炮可提供无与伦比的速度和破坏力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->redefined the art of siege with technology torn from the stars-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用从星星中夺取的技术重新定义了攻城艺术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ushered in a new age where the clash of titans is decided by the silent whisper of magnetic acceleration-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创了一个新时代，泰坦的冲突由磁力加速的无声低语决定</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->bridging worlds with the thunder of railguns-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用轨道炮的雷霆连接世界</li>
  </VFES_Railgun.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: railgun-->
  <VFES_Railgun.label>轨道炮</VFES_Railgun.label>
  <!--EN: Build ultratech shield generators that project energy fields to repel projectiles.-->
  <VFES_RepulsorTechnology.description>建造超科技护盾发生器，投射能量场来击退射弹。</VFES_RepulsorTechnology.description>
  <VFES_RepulsorTechnology.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->force fields forged-->
    <li>subject-&gt;力场伪造</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->unveiled the secrets of repulsor tech, casting domes of protection across the land-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;揭开了斥力技术的秘密，在大地上铸造了保护圆顶</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered bastions of safety, where energy shields deflect the fury of war-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的安全堡垒，其中的能量护盾可以转移战争的狂怒</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->merged the ancient dreams of invincibility with the tangible touch of science-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将古老的无敌梦想与切实的科学触摸融为一体</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ensured peace within the storm, under the watchful gaze of shimmering barriers-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在闪闪发光的屏障的注视下确保了风暴中的和平</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->weaving the fabric of defense with threads of pure energy-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用纯能量线编织防御结构</li>
  </VFES_RepulsorTechnology.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: repulsor technology-->
  <VFES_RepulsorTechnology.label>排斥器技术</VFES_RepulsorTechnology.label>
  <!--EN: Construct medieval siege equipment.-->
  <VFES_SiegeEquipment.description>建造中世纪的攻城装备。</VFES_SiegeEquipment.description>
  <VFES_SiegeEquipment.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->masters of siege-->
    <li>subject-&gt;攻城大师</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->revived ancient methods for breaching the stoutest defenses-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;复兴了突破最坚固防御的古代方法</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted engines of war that thunder across fields, striking fear into foes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心打造的战争引擎，轰鸣穿过田野，让敌人感到恐惧</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered trebuchets and battering rams from sturdy timber and iron-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;由坚固的木材和铁制成的工程投石机和攻城锤</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->led sieges that would become legendary, their tactics studied for ages-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;领导的围攻将成为传奇，他们的战术被研究了很长时间</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->laying siege to the future by rediscovering the past-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;通过重新发现过去来围攻未来</li>
  </VFES_SiegeEquipment.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: siege equipment-->
  <VFES_SiegeEquipment.label>攻城器械</VFES_SiegeEquipment.label>
  <!--EN: Adapt a trench warfare doctrine with a selection of weapons for close-quarters combat.-->
  <VWE_TrenchWarfare.description>采用一系列近距离作战武器来适应堑壕战理论。</VWE_TrenchWarfare.description>
  <VWE_TrenchWarfare.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->digging in-->
    <li>subject-&gt;深入挖掘</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->adopted the grim tactics of entrenched battles, shaping landscapes into mazes of mud and death-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;采用了坚守阵地的残酷战术，将风景塑造成泥泞和死亡的迷宫</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated with rapid entrenching tools and techniques for swift fortification-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;通过快速工兵工具和快速筑城技术进行创新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->balanced the horror of no-man's-land with the safety of well-prepared defenses-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;平衡了无人区的恐怖与准备充分的防御的安全性</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transformed warfare with the introduction of close-quarters combat within the earth's embrace-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在地球的怀抱中引入近距离战斗，改变了战争</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->embracing the earth for protection and strategy-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;拥抱地球以寻求保护和战略</li>
  </VWE_TrenchWarfare.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: trench warfare-->
  <VWE_TrenchWarfare.label>堑壕战</VWE_TrenchWarfare.label>
</LanguageData>
